cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ladrillo, please cite it as below."
title: "Ladrillo.jl: a calibrated reduced-complexity emulator of global mean sea-level rise"
type: software
## The version the GMD paper reports is the git tag v1.1.0 ("Ladrillo v1.1"); main may carry a -DEV version ahead of
## it. v1.0.0 is the code as first submitted. Update this field and date-released at each tagged release.
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
authors:
